# Guard against the recurring zip-build duplication bug: whatever builds
# Beast-MD-main-updated.zip has repeatedly nested full copies of the whole
# project under these two names. Ignored here so even if the build script
# regresses again, `git status`/`git add -A` won't re-track a duplicate copy.
Beast-MD/
beast-md-repo/
data/applications/
apply_guided_apps_patch*.py
